#basePath Day0

::OpeningPrelude
@trigger    SceneReady
@boostScore 100
@who    Astrid

$call InitUpdateMasks()
{@Astrid} Come on, Elijah, where are you? It’s already starting! $[Prelude/Astrid/01]
 
$call Wait(1)
(*phone buzzing sfx*)
 
{@Elijah} Astrid, I’m sorry I’m late!
 
{@Astrid} I was afraid you were going to miss it. The Perseids aren’t gonna last forever.
 
 
{@Elijah} Just think . . . next year on your birthday we’ll be astronomy majors in college, watching the meteor shower together. 

$call Wait(2)
Did you read my birthday card? I drew you as Perseus.$[Prelude/Elijah/06]


{@Astrid} Its really great Elijah...though I don't think I'm as tough as Perseus. $[Prelude/Astrid/07]
 
  
{@Elijah} . Girl, you're the stuff of Greek myths, ha ha.
 $[Prelude/Elijah/09]

 
{@Elijah} Can you find the Perseus constellation? $[Prelude/Elijah/11]
Just look for the place where the meteors seem to be coming from.
If you move your phone across the sky, it’ll tell you if you’re getting warmer or colder.
 
 
{@Astrid} Found it! $[Prelude/Astrid/12]
We’re so lucky to have the sky all mapped out.
It would take forever to figure all this out from scratch.
 
{@Elijah} I don’t know. Sounds sort of fun to me.
 
$call Wait(2) 
{@Astrid} Whoa. Elijah, are you seeing this? $[Prelude/Astrid/20]

{@Elijah} Astrid—you’re breaking up— $[Prelude/Elijah/20]
 
{@Astrid} Is that the Northern Lights? $[Prelude/Astrid/21]
Whoa. It’s so bright!
 
{@Elijah} (*bzzzzzzz krrrrrrr*) —Something’s not right— $[Prelude/Elijah/21]
(*static noises*) —Readings off the charts— (*brrrrrr kzzzzzz*)
 
{@Astrid} Elijah, can you hear me? $[Prelude/Astrid/22]
$call Wait(2) 
Hello? Elijah? $[Prelude/Astrid/23]

$call LoadNextDay()
